{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"知识图谱与 Agent 记忆\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">知识图谱在 Agent 记忆系统中扮演什么角色？与向量检索相比各有什么优缺点？如何设计混合记忆方案？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>知识图谱在 Agent 记忆中的作用</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">知识图谱（KG）以 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(实体, 关系, 实体)</code> 的三元组形式存储结构化知识，与向量检索相比具有以下特点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>向量检索</th>\n<th>知识图谱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>检索方式</td>\n<td>语义相似度</td>\n<td>关系遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>擅长查询</td>\n<td>\"找相似的内容\"</td>\n<td>\"找关联的实体\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多跳推理</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强（A→B→C）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>弱（黑盒相似度）</td>\n<td>强（显式关系路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新灵活性</td>\n<td>高（随时插入）</td>\n<td>低（需要维护 schema）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Agent 记忆的知识图谱应用</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>用户画像存储</strong>：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(用户A, 喜欢, React)</code>, <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(用户A, 工作于, 某公司)</code></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>事实关系维护</strong>：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(产品X, 属于, 类别Y)</code>, <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(产品X, 价格为, 100元)</code></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>经验规则存储</strong>：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(问题类型A, 解决方案, 方法B)</code>, <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">(方法B, 成功率, 0.95)</code></li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> py2neo <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Relationship\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">KGMemory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"知识图谱记忆模块\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> uri<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> password<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>uri<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> auth<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> password<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add_fact</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> subject<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> obj<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                 confidence<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> source<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"添加事实三元组\"\"\"</span>\n        tx <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>begin<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 创建或获取节点</span>\n        s_node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Entity\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>subject<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        o_node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Entity\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>obj<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        tx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>merge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>s_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Entity\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        tx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>merge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>o_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Entity\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 创建关系</span>\n        rel <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Relationship<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>s_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> o_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                          confidence<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>confidence<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> source<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>source<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        tx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>rel<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        tx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>commit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">query_related</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> entity<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                      depth<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"查询相关实体\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n            MATCH (e:Entity {name: $entity})-[:$relation]-&gt;(related)\n            RETURN related.name as name, type(r) as relation\n            \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n            MATCH (e:Entity {name: $entity})-[r]-(related)\n            RETURN related.name as name, type(r) as relation, r.confidence as conf\n            LIMIT 20\n            \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> entity<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entity<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">multi_hop_query</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> start<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> end<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_hops<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"多跳路径查询\"\"\"</span>\n        query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        MATCH path = (start:Entity {name: $start})-[:*1..$max_hops]-(end:Entity {name: $end})\n        RETURN path\n        LIMIT 5\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> start<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>start<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> end<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>end<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_hops<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>max_hops<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">update_fact</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> subject<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_obj<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"更新事实（带时间戳版本控制）\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 先标记旧关系为过期</span>\n        query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        MATCH (s:Entity {name: $subject})-[r:$relation]-&gt;(o:Entity)\n        SET r.valid_until = timestamp()\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> subject<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>subject<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 添加新关系</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_fact<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>subject<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_obj<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>混合记忆方案设计</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HybridMemorySystem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"混合记忆系统：向量检索 + 知识图谱 + 结构化数据库\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> knowledge_graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relational_db<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> vector_store      <span class=\"token comment\"># 语义检索</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kg <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> knowledge_graph              <span class=\"token comment\"># 关系推理</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>db <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> relational_db                <span class=\"token comment\"># 精确查询</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        智能路由检索\n        query_type: auto / semantic / relational / structured\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> query_type <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            query_type <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_classify_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> query_type <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"semantic\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 向量语义检索</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"semantic\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>similarity_search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> query_type <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"relational\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 知识图谱关系检索</span>\n            entities <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_extract_entities<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> entity <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> entities<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                results<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"relational\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kg<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query_related<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>entity<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> depth<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> query_type <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"structured\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 结构化数据库精确查询</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"structured\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>db<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_merge_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_classify_query</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"自动判断查询类型\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 包含\"谁\"、\"什么\"等 → 语义检索</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 包含关系词 → 关系检索</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 包含精确条件 → 结构化查询</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>w <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> query <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> w <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"谁\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"什么\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"哪些\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"相关\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"semantic\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>w <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> query <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> w <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"关系\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"关联\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"连接\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"relational\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">store_memory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"统一存储接口\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> memory_type <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"dialogue\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 对话存向量库</span>\n            embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> get_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> memory_type <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"fact\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 事实抽三元组存知识图谱</span>\n            triples <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_extract_triples<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> s<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> o <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> triples<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kg<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_fact<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>s<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> o<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> source<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> memory_type <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"structured\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 结构化数据存关系数据库</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>db<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>insert<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"table\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：知识图谱的 schema 怎么设计？答：围绕核心实体（用户、产品、概念）定义实体类型和关系类型，保持简洁可扩展。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：向量检索和知识图谱如何互补？答：先用向量检索找到相关内容，再从中提取实体到知识图谱做关系推理。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：知识图谱的维护成本怎么降低？答：使用 LLM 自动抽取三元组、定期质量检查、增量更新而非全量重建。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：知识图谱可以完全替代向量检索。两者各有擅长领域，应该互补使用。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：知识图谱越全越好。实际上维护成本很高，应该聚焦核心实体和关系。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：三元组抽取可以完全自动化。LLM 抽取有一定错误率，需要人工校验或规则过滤。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>","headings":[]}